<title>LATVIA: C.BANK LAT FIX FOR NON-CONVERTIBLE CURRENCIES.</title>
<headline>C.BANK LAT FIX FOR NON-CONVERTIBLE CURRENCIES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank set the following</p>
<p>rate for the lat against non-convertible currencies on</p>
<p>Wednesday, valid for May 12 to May 18.</p>
<p>    Belarus rouble 1000	   0.0216</p>
<p>    Kazakh tenge   1000	   7.63</p>
<p>    Azerbaijan manat 1000	 0.143</p>
<p>    Uzbek sum			 0.0096</p>
<p>    Georgian lari		   0.458</p>
<p>Armenian dinar 1000		 1.39</p>
<p>Turkmen manat  1000		 0.138</p>
<p>Tadzhik rouble 1000		 1.396</p>
<p>    Ukrainian hryvnia	     0.316</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
